<Legal title="Cookie policy" description="How redbarn.ventures uses cookies and browser storage. No advertising or tracking cookies." lead="Last updated 20 November 2026. The short version: we do not use advertising, analytics or tracking cookies on this website.">
  <section><h2>What cookies are</h2><p>Cookies are small text files that a website places on your device. Similar technologies, such as local storage and session storage, let a website remember small pieces of information in your browser. In this policy we use "cookies" to cover all of these.</p></section>
  <section><h2>What we use</h2><p>We keep cookie use to the minimum needed to run the website well. We use:</p><ul><li><b>Strictly necessary technical cookies</b> set by our hosting and security provider to deliver the site and protect it from abuse and attacks.</li><li><b>Session storage</b> to remember, for the length of your visit, that you have already seen the loading screen and how you arrived on a page, so animations are not repeated.</li><li><b>Local storage</b> to remember whether you have closed or answered our newsletter invitation, so we do not show it to you again too soon.</li></ul><p>None of these identify you personally, track you across other websites or are shared with advertisers.</p></section>
  <section><h2>What we do not use</h2><ul><li>No advertising or retargeting cookies.</li><li>No third-party analytics cookies.</li><li>No social media tracking pixels.</li><li>No cookies from font or content-delivery services - our fonts are hosted on our own servers.</li></ul><p>Because we only use strictly necessary and functional storage, you do not see a cookie consent banner on this website.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Links to other websites</h2><p>Some links on this website lead to other services, such as LinkedIn and Instagram. When you visit those services, their own cookie policies apply. We recommend reviewing them.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies and browser storage at any time in your browser settings. Blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect how the website works. Clearing local storage simply means the newsletter invitation may appear again.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Changes to this policy</h2><p>If we ever introduce analytics or marketing tools, we will update this policy first and ask for your consent wherever the law requires it. The date at the top of this page always shows the latest version.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about cookies or privacy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${E}`}>{E}</a>. You can also read our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p></section>
</Legal>
